Subject: [PATCH] VU9050: the Vacuum Unit page shows every enabled Index nozzle
 on HT9050 -- EastSun 1007 '?4????4?'.

FileRW/TestIF_File_VacuumUnit.gen.inc VU_ShowSuckMode (same line): on HT9050 (9050GPIB or Type_HT9050) an Index panel is visible when its nozzle is Enable in IO_Table (FTestSuck / BTestSuck), not by the recipe site grid (Single Site = 1x1) -> Arm1 shows A2 VC0-3 Aa/Ba/Ab/Bb. FileRW/_KitSuck.cpp end of file: FileRW_TestSuckEnabled(which,row,col) (the C-route TU cannot include mykitsuck.h). Every other machine: golden. No test covers this page; Debug compiled (link waits for EastSun's program), release linked. WORKLOG row 179.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
